#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Molten Land marker', '//~': 'NO_I18N'}
#: fork_powers.json
msgid ""
"Hidden companion of Molten Land (pyrokinetic_eruption + _knack, wired via "
"extra_effects in strip_spell_math._rewrite_molten_land).  Drops an invisible"
" fd_mom_trap_marker on the target tile so mom_hooks can find it "
"(on_spell_cast target_pos is unreadable in BN) and report whether the tile "
"actually melted.  It's a bug if you can cast it directly."
msgstr ""
"Hidden companion of Molten Land (pyrokinetic_eruption + _knack, wired via "
"extra_effects in strip_spell_math._rewrite_molten_land).  Drops an invisible"
" fd_mom_trap_marker on the target tile so mom_hooks can find it "
"(on_spell_cast target_pos is unreadable in BN) and report whether the tile "
"actually melted.  It's a bug if you can cast it directly."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mom_kinetic_trap_noise', '//~': 'NO_I18N'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mom_pyrolytic_trap_noise', '//~': 'NO_I18N'}
#: fork_powers.json
msgid ""
"Detonation noise for a primed psionic trap; cast from Lua with the victim as"
