#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Newly-Awakened Electrokinetic"
msgstr "Пробудившийся электрокинетик"

#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Newly-Awakened Electrokinetic"
msgstr "Пробудившаяся электрокинетик"

#. ~ Profession (male Newly-Awakened Electrokinetic) description
#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  While running"
" down an alleyway to escape a group of rioters, you looked back and realized"
" you were going to get caught and then there was a deafening crash of "
"thunder and your vision went white.  When your hearing and sight came back, "
"the rioters were lying in a heap, some still with smoldering clothes, and "
"you were unscathed."
msgstr ""
"Во время бурь, бушевавших в Катаклизм, что-то произошло, и теперь ты "
"способен на то, что прежде казалось невозможным. Убегая по переулку от "
"группы погромщиков, ты оглянулся и понял, что тебя вот-вот догонят. Тут "
"раздался оглушительный раскат грома, и всё перед глазами побелело. Когда "
"зрение и слух вернулись, погромщики лежали грудой, на некоторых ещё тлела "
"одежда, а ты остался невредим."

#. ~ Profession (female Newly-Awakened Electrokinetic) description
#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  While running"
" down an alleyway to escape a group of rioters, you looked back and realized"
" you were going to get caught and then there was a deafening crash of "
"thunder and your vision went white.  When your hearing and sight came back, "
"the rioters were lying in a heap, some still with smoldering clothes, and "
"you were unscathed."
msgstr ""
