"его и выживешь."

#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Newly-Awakened Telekinetic"
msgstr "Пробудившийся телекинетик"

#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Newly-Awakened Telekinetic"
msgstr "Пробудившаяся телекинетик"

#. ~ Profession (male Newly-Awakened Telekinetic) description
#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can lift "
"things with your mind.  Mostly just small things, but during the chaos a "
"group of rioters jumped you and you hurled them off of you just by thinking "
"about it.  This will definitely come in handy."
msgstr ""
"Во время бурь, бушевавших в Катаклизм, что-то произошло, и теперь ты "
"способен на то, что прежде казалось невозможным. Ты можешь поднимать вещи "
"силой мысли. В основном небольшие, но однажды среди всеобщего хаоса на тебя "
"набросилась группа погромщиков, и ты отбросил их одним мысленным усилием. "
"Это точно пригодится."

#. ~ Profession (female Newly-Awakened Telekinetic) description
#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can lift "
"things with your mind.  Mostly just small things, but during the chaos a "
"group of rioters jumped you and you hurled them off of you just by thinking "
"about it.  This will definitely come in handy."
msgstr ""
