#: items/teleporter_start_items.json
msgid "You flip the switch and activate the helmet's functions."
msgstr "Вы щёлкаете переключателем и включаете функции шлема."

#. ~ Use action transform.need_charges_msg for {'str': 'Imperial Navy battle
